{"speciesId":584,"names":{"fr":"Sorbouboul","es":"Vanilluxe","en":"Vanilluxe","ja":"バイバニラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il avale de l’eau en grande quantité et la transforme en nuages neigeux. Il souffle du blizzard sur ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and attack their foes with violent blizzards."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand ses deux têtes se fâchent en même temps, il émet un blizzard de ses cornes et enfouit les alentours sous la neige."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If both heads get angry simultaneously, this Pokémon expels a blizzard, burying everything in snow."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand ses deux têtes se fâchent en même temps, il émet un blizzard de ses cornes et enfouit les alentours sous la neige."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si sus dos cabezas se irritan al mismo tiempo, genera una ventisca desde su cuerno cubriendo su entorno con nieve."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If both heads get angry simultaneously, this Pokémon expels a blizzard, burying everything in snow."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２つの 頭が 同時に 怒ると ツノから 猛吹雪を 噴き出す。 あたりを 大雪で 埋めてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il avale de grandes quantités d’eau et la transforme en nuages de neige. Il souffle du blizzard quand il se fâche."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Absorben grandes cantidades de agua y la transforman en ventisca en su cuerpo, expulsándola cuando se enojan."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大量の 水を 飲みこんで 体の中で 雪雲に 変える。 怒ると 猛吹雪を まきおこす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand ses deux têtes se fâchent en même temps, il émet un blizzard de ses cornes et enfouit les alentours sous la neige."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si sus dos cabezas se irritan al mismo tiempo, genera una ventisca desde su cuerno cubriendo su entorno con nieve."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"If both heads get angry simultaneously, this Pokémon expels a blizzard, burying everything in snow."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２つの 頭が 同時に 怒ると ツノから 猛吹雪を 噴き出す。 あたりを 大雪で 埋めてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il avale de grandes quantités d’eau et la transforme en nuages de neige. Il souffle du blizzard quand il se fâche."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Absorben grandes cantidades de agua y la transforman en ventisca en su cuerpo, expulsándola cuando se enojan."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大量の 水を 飲みこんで 体の中で 雪雲に 変える。 怒ると 猛吹雪を まきおこす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Chacune de ses deux têtes possède un cerveau distinct. Elles doivent s’entendre pour que Sorbouboul souffle son blizzard sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Las dos cabezas tienen su propio cerebro. Cuando se ponen de acuerdo, generan una ventisca con la que atacan a su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Each of its two heads has a brain, and when they are in agreement, it attacks its enemies by exhaling a violent blizzard."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"２つの頭 それぞれに 脳があり 両者の 意見が 一致すると 猛吹雪を 吐いて 敵を 襲う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il peut perdre l’une de ses têtes et continuer à vivre sa vie sans souci. Des flocons de neige sont fabriqués en permanence dans son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Pueden sobrevivir sin grandes problemas aun perdiendo una de las cabezas. Crean ventiscas en el interior de su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Even if it loses one of its heads, it can live relatively problem-free. It makes snow clouds inside its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"片方の 頭を 失っても 特に 問題なく 生きられる。 身体の 中に 雪雲を つくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses deux bouches peuvent souffler du blizzard. Sa capacité à créer de la neige à volonté le rend populaire auprès des skieurs et snowboarders."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Expulsa ventiscas por ambas bocas y, como puede crear nieve en cualquier lugar, es famoso entre quienes practican esquí o snowboard."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It blasts blizzards from its two mouths. It can create snow anywhere, so it gets a lot of love from skiers and snowboarders."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"２つの 口から 吹雪を 吐く。 どこでも 雪を 作りだせるので スキーヤーや ボーダーに 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sorbouboul est né lorsque deux Sorboul, à moitié fondus par le soleil, se sont collés l’un à l’autre et ont été soudés par la gelée nocturne."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su nacimiento se produce cuando dos Vanillish se derriten por la mañana, se mezclan y, durante la gélida noche, se congelan juntos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vanilluxe is born when two Vanillish, half-melted by the day’s light, stick to each other and freeze together in the cold return of night."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"朝日で 溶けかけた ２匹の バニリッチが くっつき 寒い晩に 再び 凍ったとき 生まれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Lorsqu’il a les nerfs en boule, il provoque un blizzard qui gèle tout le monde, alliés comme adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando su rabia alcanza el punto máximo, genera una ventisca que congela tanto a amigos como a enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When its anger reaches a breaking point, this Pokémon unleashes a fierce blizzard that freezes every creature around it, be they friend or foe."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"怒りが 頂点に 達すると 吹雪を 噴き出して 敵も 味方も 氷漬けに する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La température de son corps est d’environ - 6 °C. On raconte que ce Pokémon naît lorsque deux Sorboul se collent l’un à l’autre."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su temperatura corporal ronda los -6 °C. Se dice que nace de la fusión de dos Vanillish."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"People believe this Pokémon formed when two Vanillish stuck together. Its body temperature is roughly 21 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体温は マイナス６度 前後。 ２匹の バニリッチが くっつき 生まれたと いわれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":584,"moves":[{"name":"mist","learns":[[11,"level-up",16],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[11,"level-up",36],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",36],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",36],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",36],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",36],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",36],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",44],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[11,"level-up",59],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",59],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",59],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",59],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",59],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",59],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",52],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[1